materials that a user independently creates, inputs, edits, records, or
prepares through ordinary use of the Ludoxel application.

For purposes of this license, "Application Output" means ordinary screenshots,
screen recordings, save files, logs, generated AI workbench records, rendered
states, configuration files, and other output produced by the Ludoxel
application through ordinary application use.

User Materials do not become Original Materials merely because the user
entered, edited, generated, saved, exported, displayed, or shared them by
using the Ludoxel application.

Subject to this license and any applicable third-party rights, users may use,
record, reproduce, publish, and share their own User Materials and
